    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Excellent two-bedroom ground floor apartment located in a sought-after development.\r\n\r\n2 Landscape Court features an inviting L-shaped entrance hall with tiled floors, a hot press, and a convenient storage room. Both bedrooms enjoy superb natural light and laminate flooring, with the master bedroom further benefiting from a fully tiled en-suite.The fully tiled family bathroom is fitted with well-maintained sanitary ware and a heated towel rail. The property boasts a bright open-plan living and dining area, which also provides direct access to the communal patio area.Completing the accommodation is a modern kitchen with tiled flooring, a tiled splashback, and ample countertop and cupboard space. This superb apartment is further enhanced by a separate utility room and a designated car parking space.\r\n\r\nLandscape Court enjoys a superb location close to an excellent range of local amenities, including the popular Dundrum Town Centre. Bushy Park, with its scenic walks along the River Dodder, is just a short stroll away, while regular bus services and the nearby M50 provide excellent access to Dublin city centre and beyond.\r\n\r\nGround Floor \r\nPrevious rent 2000\r\nManagement Fee 2310\r\nUtility Room\r\nSpacious Bedrooms\r\nStylish interior \r\nOpen plan \r\n85 m²\r\nen suite"
      },
